    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "H1 hit rate, 1 h | brand mismatch | انتحال علامة",
      "description": "Share of final verdicts where hard rule H1 fired (docs/SCORING.md section 3). Thresholds: none: a hit is a detection, not a fault; watch for sudden changes. No data: the service has not emitted this metric yet: it appears after the first event of its kind.",
