    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Evidence-type frequency, 1 h | تكرار أنواع الأدلة",
      "description": "How many final verdicts carried each evidence signal (each counted once per verdict). Thresholds: none: counts. No data: the service has not emitted this metric yet: it appears after the first event of its kind.",
